 <article class="dec "><div class="dec-txt"><span class="dn">03</span><h3>Brand pills that brands can pay for.</h3><p>The row of pills at the top of the home page (For You, Samsung, mycandy) gives a brand its own page in the app.</p><p>It became a new placement Tradeling can sell to brands.</p><div class="stat"><b>New</b><span>source of revenue</span></div></div><div class="dec-m"><div class="bp" data-a="{&quot;samsung&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/7909768a4bb3.png&quot;, &quot;mycandy&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/0304ab21817c.png&quot;, &quot;cat_phone&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/7fc951b99f96.png&quot;, &quot;cat_acc&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/b9cde8cc1d5c.png&quot;, &quot;cat_head&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/9338d21c394c.png&quot;, &quot;cat_tab&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/e525ba11a716.png&quot;, &quot;cat_watch&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/bbab23ac9fdd.png&quot;, &quot;ban_gaming&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/c3ee5f55338e.jpg&quot;, &quot;ban_cashback&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/f48fcdaa57f6.jpg&quot;, &quot;ban_phones&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/debde668a80b.jpg&quot;, &quot;br_apple&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/b492ab3fea39.png&quot;, &quot;br_lg&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/399608645e1a.png&quot;, &quot;br_nokia&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/b7b15ea009d9.png&quot;, &quot;br_sony&quot;: &quot;/work/tradeling/i/5ffc1cd20a2e.png&quot;}"><div class="bp-stage" role="img" aria-label="The axiom home page with brand pills: For You shows categories, banners, products and brands; Samsung shows Samsung categories, banners and products; mycandy shows only mycandy banners and products"></div></div></div></article>
 </div>
</div></section><section class="ch split" id="system"><div class="shell">
 <div class="ch-txt"><p class="lab">Design system</p><h2 class="claim">A design system rebuilt to scale.</h2>
 <p>I rebuilt both layers: the foundations, and the components on top.</p></div>
 <div class="ch-media">
  <div class="dsp"><p class="dsn">01 · Foundations</p><h3>One set of tokens behind every screen.</h3>
   <p>Components use semantic tokens, like bg/action, that point to raw primitives. Change one value and every screen follows. Modes switch theme (light / dark), language (EN / AR) and font size (mobile / tablet).</p></div>
  <div class="fd" role="img" aria-label="A snippet of the foundation library: colour primitives in ramps, and semantic colour tokens that point to them"><div class="fd-card"><p class="fd-h">Colors</p><p class="fd-s">Primitives: the raw palette.</p><div class="fd-ramp"><b>Blue</b><div class="fd-sw"><span><i style="background:#f4faff"></i><em>25</em></span><span><i style="background:#e0f0fa"></i><em>50</em></span><span><i style="background:#b5def5"></i><em>100</em></span><span><i style="background:#8accf0"></i><em>150</em></span><span><i style="background:#3eb8ed"></i><em>200</em></span><span><i style="background:#00a0d1"></i><em>300</em></span><span><i style="background:#0085b0"></i><em>400</em></span><span><i style="background:#006a8c"></i><em>500</em></span><span><i style="background:#004d66"></i><em>600</em></span><span><i style="background:#00394d"></i><em>700</em></span><span><i style="background:#03151e"></i><em>900</em></span></div></div><div class="fd-ramp"><b>Orange</b><div class="fd-sw"><span><i style="background:#fff8f5"></i><em>25</em></span><span><i style="background:#ffeee5"></i><em>50</em></span><span><i style="background:#ffd9c4"></i><em>100</em></span><span><i style="background:#ffbea0"></i><em>175</em></span><span><i style="background:#ff9d6f"></i><em>200</em></span><span><i style="background:#ff723d"></i><em>300</em></span><span><i style="background:#f95000"></i><em>400</em></span><span><i style="background:#bf3900"></i><em>500</em></span><span><i style="background:#8f2800"></i><em>600</em></span><span><i style="background:#5c1a00"></i><em>700</em></span><span><i style="background:#2a1003"></i><em>900</em></span></div></div><div class="fd-ramp"><b>Gray</b><div class="fd-sw"><span><i style="background:#ffffff"></i><em>0</em></span><span><i style="background:#f8f8f8"></i><em>25</em></span><span><i style="background:#f0f0f0"></i><em>50</em></span><span><i style="background:#e5e5e5"></i><em>100</em></span><span><i style="background:#d1d1d1"></i><em>150</em></span><span><i style="background:#b8b8b8"></i><em>200</em></span><span><i style="background:#a0a0a0"></i><em>300</em></span><span><i style="background:#808080"></i><em>400</em></span><span><i style="background:#666666"></i><em>500</em></span><span><i style="background:#4d4d4d"></i><em>600</em></span><span><i style="background:#333333"></i><em>700</em></span><span><i style="background:#0b0c0d"></i><em>900</em></span></div></div><div class="fd-ramp"><b>Green</b><div class="fd-sw"><span><i style="background:#f2fcf0"></i><em>25</em></span><span><i style="background:#d5f5d3"></i><em>50</em></span><span><i style="background:#a8e9a6"></i><em>100</em></span><span><i style="background:#6cd36a"></i><em>175</em></span><span><i style="background:#4bbf49"></i><em>200</em></span><span><i style="background:#3aa838"></i><em>300</em></span><span><i style="background:#2e8d2c"></i><em>400</em></span><span><i style="background:#236d21"></i><em>500</em></span><span><i style="background:#1a4f18"></i><em>600</em></span><span><i style="background:#0f320d"></i><em>700</em></span><span><i style="background:#081a06"></i><em>900</em></span></div></div><div class="fd-ramp"><b>Yellow</b><div class="fd-sw"><span><i style="background:#fff9e6"></i><em>25</em></span><span><i style="background:#ffefcc"></i><em>50</em></span><span><i style="background:#ffe099"></i><em>100</em></span><span><i style="background:#ffd166"></i><em>175</em></span><span><i style="background:#ffc043"></i><em>200</em></span><span><i style="background:#ffb020"></i><em>300</em></span><span><i style="background:#e59700"></i><em>400</em></span><span><i style="background:#cc7a00"></i><em>500</em></span><span><i style="background:#a35c00"></i><em>600</em></span><span><i style="background:#734000"></i><em>700</em></span><span><i style="background:#4d2800"></i><em>900</em></span></div></div><div class="fd-ramp"><b>Red</b><div class="fd-sw"><span><i style="background:#fff0f0"></i><em>25</em></span><span><i style="background:#ffd9d9"></i><em>50</em></span><span><i style="background:#ffb3b3"></i><em>100</em></span><span><i style="background:#ff8080"></i><em>150</em></span><span><i style="background:#ff4d4d"></i><em>200</em></span><span><i style="background:#ff2b3f"></i><em>300</em></span><span><i style="background:#e6001f"></i><em>400</em></span><span><i style="background:#b30018"></i><em>500</em></span><span><i style="background:#800011"></i><em>600</em></span><span><i style="background:#4d000a"></i><em>700</em></span><span><i style="background:#260005"></i><em>900</em></span></div></div></div><div class="fd-card fd-tok"><div class="fd-th"><p class="fd-h">TOKENS – Colors</p><p class="fd-s">Semantic tokens say how a colour is used, and point to a primitive.</p></div><div class="fd-tbl"><div class="fd-row fd-hd"><span>Token</span><span>Value</span></div><div class="fd-row"><div class="fd-tn"><b>bg/primary</b><span>Primary color for background.</span></div><div class="fd-tv"><i style="background:#ffffff"></i><code>colors/gray/0</code></div></div><div class="fd-row"><div class="fd-tn"><b>bg/brand</b><span>Use for the background of elements used to reinforce brand, that need to stand out a lot.</span></div><div class="fd-tv"><i style="background:#00394d"></i><code>colors/blue/700</code></div></div><div class="fd-row"><div class="fd-tn"><b>bg/brandTint</b><span>Use for the background of elements used to reinforce brand, that need to stand out a lot.</span></div><div class="fd-tv"><i style="background:#e0f0fa"></i><code>colors/blue/50</code></div></div><div class="fd-row"><div class="fd-tn"><b>bg/action</b><span>Background color for actions.</span></div><div class="fd-tv"><i style="background:#f95000"></i><code>colors/orange/400</code></div></div><div class="fd-row"><div class="fd-tn"><b>bg/positiveTint</b><span>Toned background color of positive elements.</span></div><div class="fd-tv"><i style="background:#d5f5d3"></i><code>colors/green/50</code></div></div><div class="fd-row"><div class="fd-tn"><b>bg/cautionTint</b><span>Toned background color of warning elements.</span></div><div class="fd-tv"><i style="background:#ffefcc"></i><code>colors/yellow/50</code></div></div><div class="fd-row"><div class="fd-tn"><b>content/primary</b><span>Primary content color.</span></div><div class="fd-tv"><i style="background:#0b0c0d"></i><code>colors/gray/900</code></div></div><div class="fd-row"><div class="fd-tn"><b>content/positive</b><span>Use for content indicating positive scenarios.</span></div><div class="fd-tv"><i style="background:#236d21"></i><code>colors/green/500</code></div></div><div class="fd-row"><div class="fd-tn"><b>border/strong</b><span>Use for active/selected items.</span></div><div class="fd-tv"><i style="background:#00394d"></i><code>colors/blue/700</code></div></div></div></div></div>
  <div class="dsp"><p class="dsn">02 · Components</p><h3>Fewer components, more props.</h3>
   <p>Every content change used to mean a new component. I audited the library and rebuilt it with nested properties, variants and props: from 50+ components to under 10, easier to maintain and ready to scale. Try it below.</p></div>
  <div class="cc" data-banner="/work/tradeling/i/70af340c0ce7.jpg"><div class="cc-stage" role="img" aria-label="The Card Carousel component: Background on or off, Header Type Text or Image, and four Product cards or four Featured cards"></div><div class="cc-panel"></div></div>
 </div>
</div></section><section class="ch" id="impact"><div class="shell">
